// Package backup.v1 is the gRPC API of backup-svc, which takes encrypted
// snapshots of a whole git2 instance and keeps them in the instance bucket.
//
// A snapshot holds everything a new server needs to become the same
// instance: the PostgreSQL database, the Git repositories, git2.yaml and the
// instance secrets, in one archive encrypted with age. The archive layout is
// documented in docs/api/snapshot-format.md of git2-deploy.
