//   - backup-svc does not authenticate or authorize callers. The caller
//     (admin-api, behind the gateway) checks that the user is an instance
//     admin before calling.
//   - List RPCs paginate per AIP-158: page_size 0 means 50, values above 100
//     are treated as 100, a negative value is INVALID_ARGUMENT, and
//     page_token is opaque.
//   - Errors use standard gRPC codes. INTERNAL and UNAVAILABLE messages are
//     generic: they never contain bucket URLs, credentials, file paths or
//     SQL.
